Hi,

we try to set up also a call-in possibility via Skype as I am not sure 
whether for a conference call on Skype I have to call you, I ask 
everyone who is interested to participate via Skype to tell me his Skype 
user ID and the sessions he wants to participate in.

Signing up as a Skype user is free and communicating between Skype 
accounts is also free. The access software is available for Linux, 
free-of-charge.

I cannot guarantee that the Skype connection will work, so keep the 
possibility open to call in by phone.

    Till
